  "Id": 527,
  "Title": "6th annual environmental excellence award 2009 for Aga Khan University",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Based on the performance and data for the year 2007 and 2008, Aga Khan University won the 6th Annual Environmental Excellence Award 2009",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Based on the performance and data for the year 2007 and 2008, Aga Khan University won the 6th Annual Environmental Excellence Award 2009 at a ceremony held in Karachi on July 9, 2009. The Award is organised each year by the National Forum for Environment & Health in collaboration with United Nations Environment Program (UNEP)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In addition to the performance and data, the criteria for the award included: the quality of Environment, Health and Safety (EHS) management programme of the organisation; leadership commitment; staff participation, goals and objectives; training programmes and progress; incident reporting and analysis; emergency preparedness, employee health monitoring programme, waste management and performance monitoring, measurement and improvement."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The University ensures the consistency of its high quality care through a meticulous process of continual quality assurance."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
